<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Hear the voice that entreats you,</l><l>O return ye unto God!</l><l>Hear the voice that entreats you,</l><l>O return ye unto God!</l><l>He is of great compassion,</l><l>And of wondrous love;</l><l>Hear the voice that entreats you,</l><l>Hear the voice that entreats you,</l><l>O return ye unto God!</l><l>O return ye unto God!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He’ll forgive your transgressions,</l><l>And remember them no more;</l><l>He’ll forgive your transgressions,</l><l>And remember them no more;</l><l>“Look unto Me, ye people,”</l><l>Saith the Lord your God!</l><l>He’ll forgive your transgressions,</l><l>He’ll forgive your transgressions,</l><l>And remember them no more,</l><l>And remember them no more.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
